-- Twelve raiders, ten worth worrying about: a pipeline can be a fold's scope. Order by one column, take k, sum a different column over the survivors.
-- The grade of the filtered dps column indexes the FILTERED threat column; the non-enemies (rows 0,3)
-- deliberately carry the extreme dps and threat values, so any index-space slip shows in the sum.
--! registry ../registries/043-fold-ordered-topk.reg
--! out 226

+/ threat @ (Enemy |> order by dps desc |> take 10)
